I am going back to school in a couple of weeks and I will miss being able
to play Nethack.  Does anyone know of FTP sites that have the MS-DOS version
of this game??  I would love to get this for my home computer.

F.Y.I. risc.ua.edu has a very good hack manual available for FTP.  It's in
pub/games/solutions called manual.hack.  It lists all mosters and their food
value and what they can do for you, and a whole bunch of other stuff.
There are alot of spoilers in there, but the big spoilers are sectioned off
so you can't accidentally read them.  Very interesting to read.

